Videx is live. Point it at a set of YouTube channels and it becomes a searchable, quotable
knowledge base — shaped around the field you actually work in.

- **Domain personalization**: choose AI Engineering, Data Science, System Design, Cybersecurity,
  Creative Tech, or the universal profile. Suggested queries, focus topics and AI prompts all
  retune, and switching is instant.
- **Transcript-first ingestion**: an InnerTube Android/Web/iOS fallback chain for captions,
  chapters and channel analytics.
- **Hybrid search**: PostgreSQL 16 full-text for the exact phrase, pgvector for the idea you can
  only describe.
- **Grounded chat**: ask a question about a video and every answer cites the second it came from.
- **Provider-agnostic AI**: summaries, topics and tagging over a fallback chain, so one provider's
  rate limit degrades the answer rather than the app.

